					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Magnus rumor his diebus sparsus est de increbrescente apud vos <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>contagione pestilente, quae ut deferbescat, dominum precor nec id facio <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>velut ignorans et parum memor dicti apostolici, quod pacificatis in Ies<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>u <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Christo omnia cooperantur in bonum, et quod alioqui scriptura testis est <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>certo beatos esse, qui in domino moriuntur, sed quod in iis tam duris tem<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>porum articulis cuperem quam minime affligi gregem domini praesertim in urbe <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>vestra, quo liberius adesse et consulere aliis ecclesiis poss[itis].</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Speramus <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>tamen melius omnia propediem habitura et nostri miserturum <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>dominum, quem scriptura testatur sarcinas tentationum importabiles suis non <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>solere imponere.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l257">Constans</placeName> fama est Caesarem hybernaturum <placeName ref="l18">Augustę</placeName>, et narrant nostri, qui recentes hab<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ent ex <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName> literas, valde metuendum, ne vere appetente hostilem exercitum ille in papam sit instructurus.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Praeter haec et a <placeName ref="l2510">Thurca</placeName> putant me<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>tuendum, ne vere appetente hostilem exercitum ille in papam sit instructurus.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Praeter haec et a <placeName ref="l2510">Thurca</placeName> putant metuendum esse <persName ref="p18538">Carolo</persName> etc.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Illud obiter te pro nostra fide rogo, das ir in gehaym mit meinem <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>günstigen und geliebten herren <persName ref="p1888">Lavater</persName> wellind reden und von ge<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>mayner unser statt wegen pittlich anlangen: welle so wol thuͦn, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>so mann herr landtschreyber oder sein gwalthaber gen <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>von siglens wegen khomen wirt, das er alle sprüch anfang bsechen <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>und lesen welle, damit sy standind, wie sy ston söllind, und ob jendert <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>groß fäl sin welte, dasselbig demm herren schryber (oder ondess <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>mit vilen geschefften und allerlay unmuͦß beladen ist) ainzezaygen, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>damit dasjenig, das recht ist, vollzogen werde.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">De scriba nil mali <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>suspicor; sed habeo compertum, quam facile sit hominem variis curis distractum <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>labi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale et me ama.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l473">S. Galli</placeName> 21. octobris anno domini 1549.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/><persName ref="p8049">Ioachimus Vadianus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Optimo et pientissimo viro D. <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><persName ref="p495">Henrycho Bullingero</persName>, amplissimae <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>urbis <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> episcopo, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>domino suo et tanquam fratri.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
